diff --git a/docs/glossary.md b/docs/glossary.md
index 1a2b3c4..5d6e7f8 100644
--- a/docs/glossary.md
+++ b/docs/glossary.md
@@ -18,7 +18,7 @@ A short glossary of the terms this repository uses.
